{"id":"882164d2452aa60b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/785_RM_3.md","title":"785 RM 3","display":"785_RM_3","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"785-RM_3\">785 RM_3</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\}\\)</span>，并定义替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{RM3}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{RM3}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{RM3}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{RM3}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 为唯一满足下列递归子句的映射：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RM3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,RM3}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RM3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,RM3}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RM3}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,RM3}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RM3}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,RM3}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-RM_3-三值矩阵\">4. RM_3 三值矩阵</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{RM3}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{RM3}=\\{\\tfrac12,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{RM3}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{RM3}=\\{\\tfrac12,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底常元解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{RM3}=0\">\\(\\bot_{RM3}=0\\)</span>。语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{RM3}:\\mathsf V_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{RM3}:\\mathsf V_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{RM3},\\vee_{RM3},\\Rightarrow_{RM3}:\n\\mathsf V_{RM3}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_{RM3},\\vee_{RM3},\\Rightarrow_{RM3}:\n\\mathsf V_{RM3}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{RM3}a=1-a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{RM3}a=1-a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_{RM3}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{RM3}b=\\max(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_{RM3}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{RM3}b=\\max(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>蕴含函数为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{c|ccc}\n\\Rightarrow_{RM3}&amp;0&amp;\\tfrac12&amp;1\\\\\n\\hline\n0&amp;1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\\n\\tfrac12&amp;0&amp;\\tfrac12&amp;1\\\\\n1&amp;0&amp;0&amp;1\n\\end{array}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{array}{c|ccc}\n\\Rightarrow_{RM3}&amp;0&amp;\\tfrac12&amp;1\\\\\n\\hline\n0&amp;1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\\n\\tfrac12&amp;0&amp;\\tfrac12&amp;1\\\\\n1&amp;0&amp;0&amp;1\n\\end{array}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>行值为前件，列值为后件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3}\">\\(\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf V_{RM3}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{RM3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{RM3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{RM3}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{RM3}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{RM3}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{RM3}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{RM3}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{RM3}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{RM3}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{RM3}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{RM3})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{RM3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{RM3})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{RM3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承与规则关系\">6. 语义后承与规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{RM3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{RM3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{RM3}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{RM3}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{RM3}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{RM3}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>MP 模式显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MPRule}_{RM3}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MPRule}_{RM3}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代换模式显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{\\widehat\\sigma(A)}\n\\qquad\n(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{\\widehat\\sigma(A)}\n\\qquad\n(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{RM3}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{RM3}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{RM3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{RM3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MPRule}_{RM3}\">\\(\\mathsf{MPRule}_{RM3}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{RM3}\">\\(\\mathsf{SubRule}_{RM3}\\)</span> 只是已定义的句法规则关系；本条目不定义 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由这些规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{RM3}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{RM3}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{RM3}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{RM3}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{RM3}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3},\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3},\\operatorname{BV}_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3},\\operatorname{Ext}_{RM3},\\equiv_{\\alpha,RM3},\n\\mathsf V_{RM3},\\mathsf D_{RM3},\\bot_{RM3},\n\\neg_{RM3},\\wedge_{RM3},\\vee_{RM3},\\Rightarrow_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3},\n\\Vdash_{RM3},\\mathsf{Valid}_{RM3},\\mathsf{MPRule}_{RM3},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{RM3}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{RM3}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3},\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RM3},\\operatorname{BV}_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{RM3},\\operatorname{Ext}_{RM3},\\equiv_{\\alpha,RM3},\n\\mathsf V_{RM3},\\mathsf D_{RM3},\\bot_{RM3},\n\\neg_{RM3},\\wedge_{RM3},\\vee_{RM3},\\Rightarrow_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{RM3},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{RM3},\n\\Vdash_{RM3},\\mathsf{Valid}_{RM3},\\mathsf{MPRule}_{RM3},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{RM3},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{RM3}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是同时指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tfrac12\">\\(\\tfrac12\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，并使用相关条件词表，尤其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tfrac12\\Rightarrow_{RM3}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12\">\\(\\tfrac12\\Rightarrow_{RM3}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\Rightarrow_{RM3}\\tfrac12=0\">\\(1\\Rightarrow_{RM3}\\tfrac12=0\\)</span>；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和显式规则关系，不含 Hilbert 证明系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"785-RM_3","text":"785 RM_3","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-RM_3-三值矩阵","text":"4. RM_3 三值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承与规则关系","text":"6. 语义后承与规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{RM3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RM3}",